    "NotProton is removed from Steam, and Steam goes back to how it was. The engine and the Steam bridge are deleted too. Your game settings stay.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotProton is removed from Steam, and Steam goes back to how it was. The engine and the Steam bridge are deleted too. Your game settings stay."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotProton будет убран из Steam, и Steam станет таким, как был. Движок и мост Steam тоже будут удалены. Ваши настройки игр останутся."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
