    "Steam updates can break NotProton. NotProton already holds back Steam versions it doesn't support yet. Turn this on to stop Steam updates completely.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam updates can break NotProton. NotProton already holds back Steam versions it doesn't support yet. Turn this on to stop Steam updates completely."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Обновления Steam могут сломать NotProton. NotProton уже сам не пускает версии Steam, которые ещё не поддерживает. Включите, чтобы полностью остановить обновления Steam."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Оновлення Steam можуть зламати NotProton. NotProton уже сам не пропускає версії Steam, які ще не підтримує. Увімкніть, щоб повністю зупинити оновлення Steam."
          }
        }
      },
      "generatesSymbol": false
    },
    "Steam was installed by another user of this Mac. Only that user can install NotProton into it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam was installed by another user of this Mac. Only that user can install NotProton into it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
